        ],
        "text": "The case concerns how the Social Security Administration determines disability eligibility, focusing on the criteria at step four (previous work) and step five (age factor)."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Petitioner",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "6f5980bc6560075a178093c69201403cd762fc57b0a3c1204f123f7b9ba78304",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-6f5980bc6560-0000-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 3,
              "start": 3
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Petitioner, the Commissioner\u2019s longstanding construction requires that a claimant be unable to perform previous work and also be unable to engage in any other substantial gainful work given age, education, and experience."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Petitioner (Jeffrey A. Lamken)",
        "citations": [
