            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 39,
              "start": 39
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Petitioner (Jeffrey A. Lamken), according to Petitioner (Jeffrey A. Lamken), according to Petitioner (Jeffrey A. Lamken), according to Petitioner (Jeffrey A. Lamken), petitioner argues that step four is a measure of severity and that the Commissioner\u2019s construction has been consistently applied for decades, affecting millions of claims."
